12.3 Ability Scripting
Abilities are defined in a lightweight scripting system.

Ability Definition File
Code
{
  "id": "pulse_emp",
  "type": "command",
  "cost": {"strategy_tokens": 2},
  "cooldown": 30,
  "effect": "disable_electronics",
  "radius": 40
}
Ability Types
Squad Abilities — smoke, breach charge, overdrive

Command Abilities — morale boost, sensor sweep

Strategic Abilities — orbital recon, logistics surge

Experimental Abilities — gravity well, teleportation

Ability Effects
Modders can script:

Damage

Status effects

Terrain manipulation

Hazard creation

Sensor disruption

Teleportation

VR‑specific interactions

