12.7 Packaging Mods
Mods are packaged as folders with:

/Units

/Buildings

/Abilities

/AI

/Factions

/Maps

/VR

/Experimental

/Assets

Packaging Rules
Mods must include a manifest

Mods must declare dependencies

Mods must declare version

Mods must pass schema validation

Mods can be uploaded to Steam Workshop or local folder

Manifest Example
Code
{
  "name": "Wastelanders Expansion",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "author": "ModderName",
  "dependencies": ["BaseGame"],
  "description": "Adds a new faction with unique units and experimental abilities."
}
